  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which of the following is true for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> that satisfies the differential equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  },
